{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t「銳眼計劃」閉路電視系統將在下周一起，啟動人面識別功能。警務處處長周一鳴形容，對市民是一種保障。<br/>\n<br/>\n保安局副局長卓孝業就提醒畢業學員，休班時可以放下工作，但是警務人員的身分和責任是不容卸下。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯︰王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T12:04:38.494404+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T11:22:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:58:05.640757+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T11:58:05.640757+00:00","content_hash":"8277f9205333dc1729d261c44d30f5b111f1817fb2418ce596efd95b8c8cf78d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}